OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet start to Thursday as
OL,6,Fshowery rain, sometimes heavy with
OL,7,Fthunder and hail, moves southwards
OL,8,Facross the region. This gradually
OL,9,Fclearing to leave a brighter
OL,10,Fafternoon, with just a few lighter
OL,11,Fshowers. Feeling cool in the northerly
OL,12,Fbreeze.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FShowers fading during the
OL,15,Fevening, then becoming largely dry
OL,16,Fovernight with clear spells and light
OL,17,Fwinds. A notably chillier night than
OL,18,Fof late.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,166,160,301,260,100,100
