OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FMostly dry to begin Friday
OL,6,Fwith a good number of sunny spells. A
OL,7,Ffew showers developing during the day,
OL,8,Fbut these lighter and more isolated
OL,9,Fthan those on Thursday.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,12,FBecoming more settled into the outlook
OL,13,Fperiod with an increasing number of
OL,14,Fsunny spells. Small chance of a shower
OL,15,Fover the Cumbrian Fells on Sunday.
OL,16,FTemperatures below average for August.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
